cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "rx-incrementality: industry payments and physician prescribing on public CMS data"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sana
    given-names: Ramana Prabhu
repository-code: "https://github.com/ramanaprabhusana/rx-incrementality"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-11"
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - pharmaceutical promotion
  - Open Payments
  - Medicare Part D
  - difference-in-differences
abstract: >-
  Estimates the effect of pharmaceutical industry payments on physician
  prescribing of diabetes drugs from public CMS data for 2019 to 2024, using
  physician-by-drug, physician-by-year and drug-by-year fixed effects, a cohort
  event study and Rambachan and Roth sensitivity bounds. Every estimator is
  first scored against simulated panels with a known true effect.
